    "name": "Toronto",
    "instructions": "1. Combine the rye whiskey, Fernet-Branca, syrup and bitters in a cocktail mixing glass (or any other type of glass).\n2. Fill the mixing glass with 1 handful ice and stir continuously for 30 seconds.\n3. Strain into a glass.",
    "created_at": null,
