    "description": "This flavorful Toronto cocktail combines the depth and warmth of whiskey with the intrigue of herbal Fernet-Branca liqueur.\n\nA recipe for the Fernet Cocktail calling for equal parts fernet and either cognac or rye whiskey was first printed in Robert Vermeire's 1922 Cocktails: How to Mix Them with the addendum that \"this cocktail is much appreciated by the Canadians of Toronto.\"",
